+<h1>Electric model: whole-car design review</h1>
+<p>The main gap is a rounded body paired with an angular cabin. The next pass should resolve silhouette and broad surfaces before adding assemblies. <a href="../../ELECTRIC_DESIGN_REVIEW_2026_10_26.md">Read the findings and proposed sequence</a>.</p>
