+<figure><a id="reference-link" href="references/lucid-air-front.webp"><img id="reference-image" src="references/lucid-air-front.webp" alt="Official Lucid Air front three-quarter reference"></a><figcaption><span id="reference-caption">Lucid Air — front three-quarter</span><br><small id="credit"></small></figcaption></figure>
+</div>
+<p><small>Click an image for its original file. Photographs use different cameras and lighting; these are design comparisons, not registered overlays. Neutral grey changes only paint colours in the capture process. Production geometry and materials are retained. Manufacturer references are for this local review and are outside the game export.</small></p>
+<div class="metrics"><span><strong>169,821</strong> full triangles</span><span><strong>69,761</strong> simple triangles</span><span><strong>38.44%</strong> full geometry in wheel assemblies</span><span><strong>44</strong> fresh native captures</span></div>
+<figure class="detail"><a href="native/full-side.png"><img src="native/full-side.png" alt="Unmodified full model in exact side projection"></a><figcaption>The side silhouette is the strongest diagnostic: roof corners, straight screen transitions and separate sill remain clear without coloured paint.</figcaption></figure>
