+const notes={
+'front-quarter':'DR01 / DR02: compare the cabin-to-body relationship, the thick bonnet surround and the depth of the lighting assembly.',
+'side':'DR01 / DR05 / DR07: inspect the roof corners, rear-screen descent, wheel/body relationship and lower bumper terminations.',
+'front':'DR02 / DR06: inspect the raised outer shoulders, bonnet-to-wing balance and emissive stripe in its dark housing.',
+'rear-quarter':'DR01 / DR04: compare the rear window, deck, shoulder and lamp as a connected form.',
+'rear':'DR04: inspect the broad bumper face, plate recess and lamp placement.',
+'top':'DR01 / DR02: the bonnet now tapers cleanly; the cabin still has a rectangular roof plan and abrupt corner transitions.',
+'bonnet':'DR02: the seam is cleaner, but the inset-lid appearance and heavy surrounding wing remain.',
+'roof':'DR01 / DR03: inspect the hard roof-to-pillar transitions, straight glass borders and material response.',
+'wheel':'DR05: inspect the soft twisted spokes, flat-looking brake disc and rim/barrel separation.',
+'tail-detail':'DR04 / DR07: inspect tail assembly integration and the broken dark slivers along the deck edge.',
+'production-camera-studio':'Normal default overhead profile, stationary, over the diagnostic studio. This is not a race-scene capture. Large forms remain more useful than tiny assembly detail.'};
